-Dfile.encoding=UTF8
-Xms1G
-Xmx3G
-Xss4M
-XX:+UseG1GC
# ISS-799: JDK 24/25 C2 JIT nondeterministically miscompiles dotty scaladoc's
# SignatureBuilder combinators (Option.fold/foldLeft lambdas), yielding
# "NullPointerException: ... SignatureBuilder.content() is null" during
# sge/Compile/doc (upstream scala/scala3#24183, dupes #24363/#25053/#25306;
# fixed in Scala 3.9.0 by scala/scala3#25779). Until we are on >= 3.9.0, keep
# the whole class out of the JIT: interpreted execution cannot produce the
# miscompiled null. Cost is negligible (scaladoc signature rendering only).
-XX:CompileCommand=exclude,dotty/tools/scaladoc/translators/SignatureBuilder.*
-XX:CompileCommand=dontinline,dotty/tools/scaladoc/translators/SignatureBuilder.*
